ns for drilling wells, their geometry and test strata. The accumulated experience in exploration and development of productive deposits of the pre-Jurassic complex allows us to assess the geometry and features of objects of interest in this interval, select the most informative methods for their mapping and methods for creating digital geological models that are the basis for designing the development.	2026-10-30 00:20:19.063034+05
