r the selection of optimal algorithms for geological modeling and adequate honoring of the reservoir heterogeneity. The conclusion about facies and the evolution of fluvial sedimentation for the lower part of the Tyumen Formation is presented first time for the southeastern region of Western Siberia.	2026-10-30 00:20:19.063034+05
